## Overview

**Valerix Lung Cancer Detection System** is an advanced Deep Learning solution designed to assist in the early detection of lung cancer using CT scan and medical imaging data.

The system leverages Convolutional Neural Networks (CNNs) to analyze lung scan images, identify suspicious patterns, and classify cases into diagnostic categories. By combining medical imaging with Artificial Intelligence, Valerix aims to support healthcare professionals with faster and more accurate screening.

---

## Why This Project?

Lung cancer remains one of the leading causes of cancer-related deaths worldwide. Early diagnosis significantly improves treatment outcomes and survival rates.

Traditional diagnosis requires extensive manual analysis by radiologists. Valerix introduces an intelligent AI-assisted approach that:

- Detects cancerous patterns automatically
- Reduces diagnosis time
- Improves screening efficiency
- Supports medical decision-making
- Provides visual interpretability using AI

---

