## Project Highlights

### Medical Image Processing

The system performs:

- Image Normalization
- Image Resizing
- Noise Reduction
- Feature Enhancement
- Data Augmentation

### Cancer Classification

Possible classifications include:

- Normal
- Benign
- Malignant

### AI Explainability

Grad-CAM technology highlights image regions influencing model predictions, helping improve transparency and trust in AI-assisted diagnosis.

