## Deep Learning Architecture

```text
Input CT Scan Image
          │
          ▼
Conv2D Layer
          │
          ▼
MaxPooling Layer
          │
          ▼
Conv2D Layer
          │
          ▼
MaxPooling Layer
          │
          ▼
Flatten Layer
          │
          ▼
Dense Layer
          │
          ▼
Dropout Layer
          │
          ▼
Output Classification
```

