## Installation

### Clone Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/abdulmajeedhub/Valerix-Lung-Cancer-Detection.git
```

### Navigate to Project

```bash
cd Valerix-Lung-Cancer-Detection
```

### Create Virtual Environment

```bash
python -m venv venv
```

### Activate Environment

Windows:

```bash
venv\Scripts\activate
```

Linux / macOS:

```bash
source venv/bin/activate
```

### Install Dependencies

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

---

## Run the Application

### Train Model

```bash
python train_model.py
```

### Launch Application

```bash
python app.py
```

Open:

```text
http://127.0.0.1:5000
```

